  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - SMART GRID TECHNOLOGIES REVERSE TRADE MISSION, through MFM Lamey Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $197,000 reverse trade mission familiarizes Brazilian regulatory and private power utility company representatives with the most recent regulatory advancements in the U.S. smart grids arena and exposes them to related U.S. solutions to assure an effective implementation of smart grid networks in Brazil.</narrative>
